#ASSERT `the power may be exercised or the function or duty performed by a majority of those persons` 4 3 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- R14b s 32A(1)
#ASSERT `the act or thing is regarded as done by the body` 8 TRUE 4 2 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- R15 s 32A(2)(b): exactly half of those present is not a majority
#ASSERT `a quorum is constituted at the meeting` 4 (JUST 4) 4 2 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- R16a s 32A(2)(a)(i): fixed 4, half is 2
#ASSERT `a quorum is constituted at the meeting` 4 (JUST 4) 4 1 FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- R16b s 32A(2)(a)(i): fixed 4
